# Retro-Mutation on Bot1's own Llanowar Elves: "Enchanted creature is a Turtle with base power and toughness 0/1. It can't
# attack and loses all abilities." The Elves is a 0/1 Turtle (its Elf and Druid types are gone, it is still a green creature),
# and in turn three, long past summoning sickness, its mana ability is gone (refused) and it can't attack (refused), while Ornithopter attacks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Retro-Mutation
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
